{"id":"dudoan-04","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-04/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":431.03,"segments":[{"start":0.05,"end":9.33,"text":"Section 3 You will hear two first-year art students called Max and Abby talking about their end-of-year art exhibition.","words":[["Section",0.05,0.65],["3",0.65,1.17],["You",1.17,2.55],["will",2.55,2.77],["hear",2.77,2.99],["two",2.99,3.39],["first",3.39,3.81],["-year",3.81,4.07],["art",4.07,4.39],["students",4.39,4.83],["called",4.83,5.29],["Max",5.29,5.65],["and",5.65,6.01],["Abby",6.01,6.27],["talking",6.27,7.17],["about",7.17,7.51],["their",7.51,7.79],["end",7.79,8.05],["-of",8.05,8.17],["-year",8.17,8.39],["art",8.39,8.75],["exhibition.",8.75,9.33]]},{"start":10.15,"end":65.74,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26 on page 5. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["First",10.15,10.71],["you",10.71,10.93],["have",10.93,11.09],["some",11.09,11.25],["time",11.25,11.63],["to",11.63,11.89],["look",11.89,11.99],["at",11.99,12.15],["questions",12.15,12.43],["21",12.43,13.23],["to",13.23,13.49],["26",13.49,13.99],["on",13.99,14.91],["page",14.91,15.21],["5.",15.21,15.75],["Now",61.54,61.86],["listen",61.86,62.22],["carefully",62.22,62.7],["and",62.7,63.32],["answer",63.32,63.66],["questions",63.66,64.08],["21",64.08,64.9],["to",64.9,65.2],["26.",65.2,65.74]]},{"start":69.19,"end":75.43,"text":"So, Abby, we have to prepare our individual displays for the end-of-year exhibition to","words":[["So,",69.19,69.71],["Abby,",70.07,70.25],["we",70.81,71.01],["have",71.01,71.15],["to",71.15,71.29],["prepare",71.29,71.65],["our",71.65,71.99],["individual",71.99,72.57],["displays",72.57,73.05],["for",73.05,73.51],["the",73.51,73.65],["end",73.65,73.83],["-of",73.83,73.95],["-year",73.95,74.11],["exhibition",74.11,74.69],["to",74.69,75.43]]},{"start":75.43,"end":78.95,"text":"showcase all the work we've done for the first year of our art degree.","words":[["showcase",75.43,75.77],["all",75.77,76.11],["the",76.11,76.23],["work",76.23,76.49],["we've",76.49,76.85],["done",76.85,77.05],["for",77.05,77.27],["the",77.27,77.37],["first",77.37,77.65],["year",77.65,78.03],["of",78.03,78.21],["our",78.21,78.35],["art",78.35,78.65],["degree.",78.65,78.95]]},{"start":79.47,"end":84.69,"text":"Yeah, Max. I've been thinking about how to put it all together. I'm excited about letting","words":[["Yeah,",79.47,79.91],["Max.",80.11,80.29],["I've",80.67,80.89],["been",80.89,81.03],["thinking",81.03,81.29],["about",81.29,81.59],["how",81.59,81.83],["to",81.83,82.01],["put",82.01,82.19],["it",82.19,82.35],["all",82.35,82.51],["together.",82.51,82.87],["I'm",83.45,83.73],["excited",83.73,84.09],["about",84.09,84.39],["letting",84.39,84.69]]},{"start":84.69,"end":87.45,"text":"my friends and family see all the stuff I've produced.","words":[["my",84.69,84.89],["friends",84.89,85.19],["and",85.19,85.49],["family",85.49,85.91],["see",85.91,86.25],["all",86.25,86.45],["the",86.45,86.57],["stuff",86.57,86.85],["I've",86.85,87.09],["produced.",87.09,87.45]]},{"start":87.95,"end":93.23,"text":"Me too. Actually, I'm really keen to see the work of the other students on our course.","words":[["Me",87.95,88.15],["too.",88.15,88.45],["Actually,",89.11,89.59],["I'm",90.01,90.23],["really",90.23,90.45],["keen",90.45,90.77],["to",90.77,91.01],["see",91.01,91.19],["the",91.19,91.35],["work",91.35,91.53],["of",91.53,91.73],["the",91.73,91.85],["other",91.85,92.01],["students",92.01,92.49],["on",92.49,92.81],["our",92.81,92.97],["course.",92.97,93.23]]},{"start":93.75,"end":96.59,"text":"I mean, it'll be great to see all the finished displays.","words":[["I",93.75,93.99],["mean,",93.99,94.11],["it'll",94.45,94.63],["be",94.63,94.73],["great",94.73,94.95],["to",94.95,95.17],["see",95.17,95.39],["all",95.39,95.57],["the",95.57,95.69],["finished",95.69,95.95],["displays.",95.95,96.59]]},{"start":96.59,"end":100.67,"text":"But we've seen what they've been doing throughout the year already, really.","words":[["But",96.59,97.45],["we've",97.45,97.81],["seen",97.81,98.03],["what",98.03,98.25],["they've",98.25,98.49],["been",98.49,98.65],["doing",98.65,98.85],["throughout",98.85,99.21],["the",99.21,99.51],["year",99.51,99.77],["already,",99.77,100.21],["really.",100.39,100.67]]},{"start":101.65,"end":105.37,"text":"Anyway, what about getting feedback on our exhibition from our tutor?","words":[["Anyway,",101.65,102.11],["what",102.51,102.65],["about",102.65,102.89],["getting",102.89,103.19],["feedback",103.19,103.63],["on",103.63,103.97],["our",103.97,104.13],["exhibition",104.13,104.53],["from",104.53,104.83],["our",104.83,105.03],["tutor?",105.03,105.37]]},{"start":106.23,"end":107.49,"text":"I wonder what that'll be like?","words":[["I",106.23,106.41],["wonder",106.41,106.61],["what",106.61,106.79],["that'll",106.79,107.07],["be",107.07,107.21],["like?",107.21,107.49]]},{"start":107.93,"end":110.83,"text":"Hmm, I'm a bit nervous about that part.","words":[["Hmm,",107.93,108.35],["I'm",108.97,109.19],["a",109.19,109.27],["bit",109.27,109.41],["nervous",109.41,109.83],["about",109.83,110.19],["that",110.19,110.45],["part.",110.45,110.83]]},{"start":111.07,"end":116.09,"text":"I hope our stuff ends up looking as good as some of the displays in last year's exhibition.","words":[["I",111.07,111.45],["hope",111.45,112.25],["our",112.25,112.43],["stuff",112.43,112.63],["ends",112.63,112.91],["up",112.91,113.07],["looking",113.07,113.27],["as",113.27,113.51],["good",113.51,113.67],["as",113.67,113.81],["some",113.81,114.03],["of",114.03,114.15],["the",114.15,114.25],["displays",114.25,114.59],["in",114.59,114.91],["last",114.91,115.21],["year's",115.21,115.59],["exhibition.",115.59,116.09]]},{"start":116.41,"end":120.33,"text":"Yeah, do you remember that display of printed textiles?","words":[["Yeah,",116.41,116.79],["do",117.49,117.69],["you",117.69,117.79],["remember",117.79,117.99],["that",117.99,118.25],["display",118.25,118.77],["of",118.77,119.03],["printed",119.03,119.43],["textiles?",119.43,120.33]]},{"start":120.75,"end":125.55,"text":"Fantastic mixtures of silk and wool, all coloured with natural dyes.","words":[["Fantastic",120.75,121.27],["mixtures",121.27,121.93],["of",121.93,122.23],["silk",122.23,122.65],["and",122.65,122.95],["wool,",122.95,123.35],["all",123.89,124.15],["coloured",124.15,124.55],["with",124.55,124.79],["natural",124.79,125.15],["dyes.",125.15,125.55]]},{"start":125.55,"end":132.25,"text":"Yeah, I can't actually remember that. What sticks in my mind are those ten wooden reproductions","words":[["Yeah,",125.55,126.23],["I",126.57,126.81],["can't",126.81,127.15],["actually",127.15,127.45],["remember",127.45,127.79],["that.",127.79,128.25],["What",128.97,129.17],["sticks",129.17,129.39],["in",129.39,129.63],["my",129.63,129.93],["mind",129.93,130.35],["are",130.35,130.51],["those",130.51,130.73],["ten",130.73,131.09],["wooden",131.09,131.41],["reproductions",131.41,132.25]]},{"start":132.25,"end":137.77,"text":"one student made, all of different types of transport, little cars and trains and stuff?","words":[["one",132.25,132.53],["student",132.53,132.85],["made,",132.85,133.29],["all",133.71,133.89],["of",133.89,134.01],["different",134.01,134.29],["types",134.29,134.55],["of",134.55,134.73],["transport,",134.73,135.27],["little",135.97,136.19],["cars",136.19,136.67],["and",136.67,136.95],["trains",136.95,137.25],["and",137.25,137.51],["stuff?",137.51,137.77]]},{"start":138.11,"end":144.53,"text":"Yes, it was really delicate work and much harder to do than if he'd tried to construct","words":[["Yes,",138.11,138.59],["it",139.39,139.59],["was",139.59,139.75],["really",139.75,140.01],["delicate",140.01,140.49],["work",140.49,140.91],["and",140.91,141.15],["much",141.15,141.43],["harder",141.43,141.81],["to",141.81,142.05],["do",142.05,142.45],["than",142.45,142.69],["if",142.69,143.25],["he'd",143.25,143.43],["tried",143.43,143.71],["to",143.71,143.95],["construct",143.95,144.53]]},{"start":144.53,"end":145.39,"text":"them out of metal.","words":[["them",144.53,144.77],["out",144.77,144.93],["of",144.93,145.09],["metal.",145.09,145.39]]},{"start":146.35,"end":151.19,"text":"So our tutor asked us to come up with a name for our display which reflects the","words":[["So",146.35,146.75],["our",146.75,147.19],["tutor",147.19,147.51],["asked",147.51,147.95],["us",147.95,148.15],["to",148.15,148.29],["come",148.29,148.47],["up",148.47,148.59],["with",148.59,148.77],["a",148.77,148.89],["name",148.89,149.35],["for",149.35,149.59],["our",149.59,149.79],["display",149.79,150.19],["which",150.19,150.57],["reflects",150.57,150.91],["the",150.91,151.19]]},{"start":151.19,"end":153.71,"text":"work we've done. What have you gone for?","words":[["work",151.19,151.45],["we've",151.45,151.77],["done.",151.77,152.01],["What",152.61,152.97],["have",152.97,153.11],["you",153.11,153.23],["gone",153.23,153.47],["for?",153.47,153.71]]},{"start":153.71,"end":159.11,"text":"Well, most of what I've done has focused on the countryside, so I've been thinking","words":[["Well,",153.71,154.39],["most",154.75,154.97],["of",154.97,155.19],["what",155.19,155.35],["I've",155.35,155.55],["done",155.55,155.73],["has",155.73,155.93],["focused",155.93,156.29],["on",156.29,156.67],["the",156.67,156.83],["countryside,",156.83,157.33],["so",157.73,158.33],["I've",158.33,158.67],["been",158.67,158.79],["thinking",158.79,159.11]]},{"start":159.11,"end":165.89,"text":"of things connected to that. A lot of my larger pieces are views of farmland. That's not a","words":[["of",159.11,159.31],["things",159.31,159.61],["connected",159.61,160.11],["to",160.11,160.39],["that.",160.39,160.63],["A",161.41,161.59],["lot",161.59,161.69],["of",161.69,161.81],["my",161.81,161.95],["larger",161.95,162.33],["pieces",162.33,162.77],["are",162.77,163.21],["views",163.21,163.49],["of",163.49,163.79],["farmland.",163.79,164.47],["That's",165.07,165.63],["not",165.63,165.77],["a",165.77,165.89]]},{"start":165.89,"end":171.55,"text":"particularly memorable name, though. I've gone for Mother Nature in the end, though","words":[["particularly",165.89,166.39],["memorable",166.39,167.03],["name,",167.03,167.53],["though.",167.69,167.93],["I've",168.69,168.99],["gone",168.99,169.15],["for",169.15,169.41],["Mother",169.41,169.87],["Nature",169.87,170.29],["in",170.29,170.61],["the",170.61,170.75],["end,",170.75,170.99],["though",171.41,171.55]]},{"start":171.55,"end":176.59,"text":"I did think about the name Seasons as the fields are shown at different times over the","words":[["I",171.55,171.77],["did",171.77,171.93],["think",171.93,172.17],["about",172.17,172.41],["the",172.41,172.59],["name",172.59,172.87],["Seasons",172.87,173.63],["as",173.63,174.33],["the",174.33,174.51],["fields",174.51,174.87],["are",174.87,175.05],["shown",175.05,175.33],["at",175.33,175.53],["different",175.53,175.77],["times",175.77,176.15],["over",176.15,176.45],["the",176.45,176.59]]},{"start":176.59,"end":177.31,"text":"farming year.","words":[["farming",176.59,176.91],["year.",176.91,177.31]]},{"start":177.45,"end":178.05,"text":"Oh, okay.","words":[["Oh,",177.45,177.67],["okay.",177.73,178.05]]},{"start":178.63,"end":181.89,"text":"Do you think it's going to be challenging putting our displays together?","words":[["Do",178.63,179.01],["you",179.01,179.15],["think",179.15,179.27],["it's",179.27,179.57],["going",179.57,179.77],["to",179.77,179.91],["be",179.91,180.01],["challenging",180.01,180.43],["putting",180.43,180.85],["our",180.85,181.09],["displays",181.09,181.41],["together?",181.41,181.89]]},{"start":181.89,"end":187.47,"text":"Well, I've pretty much come to a conclusion about which pieces I'll include now. I'll","words":[["Well,",181.89,182.69],["I've",182.89,183.13],["pretty",183.13,183.45],["much",183.45,183.77],["come",183.77,183.95],["to",183.95,184.09],["a",184.09,184.23],["conclusion",184.23,184.61],["about",184.61,184.95],["which",184.95,185.33],["pieces",185.33,185.79],["I'll",185.79,186.01],["include",186.01,186.31],["now.",186.31,186.77],["I'll",187.27,187.47]]},{"start":187.47,"end":192.09,"text":"have to miss out some of my preparatory drawings for the bigger pieces to make sure my best","words":[["have",187.47,187.61],["to",187.61,187.73],["miss",187.73,187.87],["out",187.87,188.07],["some",188.07,188.27],["of",188.27,188.41],["my",188.41,188.59],["preparatory",188.59,189.15],["drawings",189.15,189.65],["for",189.65,190.17],["the",190.17,190.29],["bigger",190.29,190.51],["pieces",190.51,190.97],["to",190.97,191.29],["make",191.29,191.45],["sure",191.45,191.65],["my",191.65,191.81],["best",191.81,192.09]]},{"start":192.09,"end":196.93,"text":"work fits into the space we've been allocated. I'm more concerned about how long it will","words":[["work",192.09,192.33],["fits",192.33,192.59],["into",192.59,192.87],["the",192.87,193.01],["space",193.01,193.31],["we've",193.31,193.63],["been",193.63,193.75],["allocated.",193.75,194.19],["I'm",195.11,195.39],["more",195.39,195.53],["concerned",195.53,195.79],["about",195.79,196.11],["how",196.11,196.35],["long",196.35,196.67],["it",196.67,196.81],["will",196.81,196.93]]},{"start":196.93,"end":198.43,"text":"take me to put everything in place.","words":[["take",196.93,197.15],["me",197.15,197.31],["to",197.31,197.43],["put",197.43,197.57],["everything",197.57,197.93],["in",197.93,198.09],["place.",198.09,198.43]]},{"start":199.23,"end":201.67,"text":"We've got a day and a half. That'll be plenty.","words":[["We've",199.23,199.57],["got",199.57,199.69],["a",199.69,199.79],["day",199.79,199.97],["and",199.97,200.11],["a",200.11,200.23],["half.",200.23,200.51],["That'll",200.87,201.15],["be",201.15,201.31],["plenty.",201.31,201.67]]},{"start":202.15,"end":208.43,"text":"Hmm, we'll see. What about writing the summary of our work? It's for people who","words":[["Hmm,",202.15,202.45],["we'll",202.75,203.09],["see.",203.09,203.39],["What",204.19,204.65],["about",204.65,204.97],["writing",204.97,205.35],["the",205.35,205.61],["summary",205.61,206.03],["of",206.03,206.27],["our",206.27,206.43],["work?",206.43,206.79],["It's",207.43,207.77],["for",207.77,207.89],["people",207.89,208.15],["who",208.15,208.43]]},{"start":208.43,"end":213.95,"text":"visit the exhibition to read and I'm absolutely certain they will. It explains the reasons","words":[["visit",208.43,208.69],["the",208.69,208.91],["exhibition",208.91,209.51],["to",209.51,209.87],["read",209.87,210.19],["and",210.19,210.71],["I'm",210.71,210.87],["absolutely",210.87,211.23],["certain",211.23,211.67],["they",211.67,211.89],["will.",211.89,212.19],["It",212.77,212.87],["explains",212.87,213.29],["the",213.29,213.57],["reasons",213.57,213.95]]},{"start":213.95,"end":219.69,"text":"behind our work and they'll want to know what it all means. We've got a straight word limit","words":[["behind",213.95,214.35],["our",214.35,214.75],["work",214.75,215.15],["and",215.15,215.71],["they'll",215.71,215.95],["want",215.95,216.15],["to",216.15,216.31],["know",216.31,216.41],["what",216.41,216.57],["it",216.57,216.67],["all",216.67,216.85],["means.",216.85,217.25],["We've",218.17,218.51],["got",218.51,218.59],["a",218.59,218.71],["straight",218.71,219.01],["word",219.01,219.37],["limit",219.37,219.69]]},{"start":219.69,"end":224.69,"text":"to stick to but I've got so much to say it won't be easy to say it in so few words.","words":[["to",219.69,219.97],["stick",219.97,220.15],["to",220.15,220.41],["but",220.41,221.01],["I've",221.01,221.19],["got",221.19,221.27],["so",221.27,221.49],["much",221.49,221.75],["to",221.75,221.93],["say",221.93,222.23],["it",222.23,222.39],["won't",222.39,222.59],["be",222.59,222.77],["easy",222.77,223.09],["to",223.09,223.23],["say",223.23,223.45],["it",223.45,223.61],["in",223.61,223.73],["so",223.73,223.95],["few",223.95,224.21],["words.",224.21,224.69]]},{"start":226.07,"end":232.39,"text":"So what about other organisational stuff? We'll need good lighting for one thing. The","words":[["So",226.07,226.59],["what",226.59,227.11],["about",227.11,227.29],["other",227.29,227.63],["organisational",227.63,228.55],["stuff?",228.55,228.95],["We'll",229.65,230.03],["need",230.03,230.23],["good",230.23,230.49],["lighting",230.49,230.91],["for",230.91,231.21],["one",231.21,231.41],["thing.",231.41,231.71],["The",232.25,232.39]]},{"start":232.39,"end":237.35,"text":"technical guys are doing that aren't they? Yeah. One thing to do is copy a load of","words":[["technical",232.39,232.73],["guys",232.73,233.13],["are",233.13,233.27],["doing",233.27,233.45],["that",233.45,233.71],["aren't",233.71,233.95],["they?",233.95,234.17],["Yeah.",234.27,234.57],["One",235.23,235.61],["thing",235.61,235.93],["to",235.93,236.15],["do",236.15,236.37],["is",236.37,236.65],["copy",236.65,236.87],["a",236.87,237.05],["load",237.05,237.21],["of",237.21,237.35]]},{"start":237.35,"end":242.09,"text":"comment forms so people can write what they think of the exhibition. Hopefully they'll","words":[["comment",237.35,237.71],["forms",237.71,238.21],["so",238.21,238.77],["people",238.77,239.07],["can",239.07,239.29],["write",239.29,239.47],["what",239.47,239.67],["they",239.67,239.83],["think",239.83,240.09],["of",240.09,240.21],["the",240.21,240.31],["exhibition.",240.31,240.81],["Hopefully",241.43,241.83],["they'll",241.83,242.09]]},{"start":242.09,"end":247.67,"text":"be kind. I'm sure they will. I don't know about the journalists who've been invited","words":[["be",242.09,242.21],["kind.",242.21,242.55],["I'm",243.07,243.41],["sure",243.41,243.61],["they",243.61,243.79],["will.",243.79,244.09],["I",244.87,245.19],["don't",245.19,245.39],["know",245.39,245.53],["about",245.53,245.75],["the",245.75,245.89],["journalists",245.89,246.59],["who've",246.59,247.05],["been",247.05,247.21],["invited",247.21,247.67]]},{"start":247.67,"end":254.07,"text":"though. They might not be quite as nice to us. Well, fingers crossed, you never know.","words":[["though.",247.67,248.01],["They",248.59,248.89],["might",248.89,249.11],["not",249.11,249.35],["be",249.35,249.57],["quite",249.57,249.93],["as",249.93,250.21],["nice",250.21,250.49],["to",250.49,250.77],["us.",250.77,250.97],["Well,",251.45,251.91],["fingers",252.17,252.47],["crossed,",252.47,252.97],["you",253.41,253.59],["never",253.59,253.79],["know.",253.79,254.07]]},{"start":257.57,"end":262.99,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at Questions 27","words":[["Before",257.57,258.05],["you",258.05,258.33],["hear",258.33,258.63],["the",258.63,258.83],["rest",258.83,259.07],["of",259.07,259.21],["the",259.21,259.29],["discussion,",259.29,259.71],["you",260.27,260.45],["have",260.45,260.65],["some",260.65,260.83],["time",260.83,261.23],["to",261.23,261.51],["look",261.51,261.63],["at",261.63,261.77],["Questions",261.77,262.07],["27",262.07,262.99]]},{"start":292.51,"end":299.09,"text":"So, our tutor suggested visiting a few exhibitions to look at the way work is presented and to","words":[["So,",292.51,293.07],["our",293.39,293.61],["tutor",293.61,293.89],["suggested",293.89,294.37],["visiting",294.37,295.01],["a",295.01,295.27],["few",295.27,295.43],["exhibitions",295.43,296.13],["to",296.13,296.65],["look",296.65,296.79],["at",296.79,296.93],["the",296.93,297.05],["way",297.05,297.21],["work",297.21,297.57],["is",297.57,297.73],["presented",297.73,298.21],["and",298.21,298.91],["to",298.91,299.09]]},{"start":299.09,"end":303.03,"text":"give us a few ideas about improving and displaying our own work.","words":[["give",299.09,299.21],["us",299.21,299.35],["a",299.35,299.47],["few",299.47,299.63],["ideas",299.63,300.09],["about",300.09,300.55],["improving",300.55,301.35],["and",301.35,301.73],["displaying",301.73,302.13],["our",302.13,302.51],["own",302.51,302.69],["work.",302.69,303.03]]},{"start":303.41,"end":308.73,"text":"Yeah, I liked the On the Water exhibition. The way the artist used the brush strokes","words":[["Yeah,",303.41,303.81],["I",304.05,304.21],["liked",304.21,304.51],["the",304.51,304.71],["On",304.71,305.01],["the",305.01,305.17],["Water",305.17,305.59],["exhibition.",305.59,306.31],["The",306.85,306.97],["way",306.97,307.11],["the",307.11,307.27],["artist",307.27,307.55],["used",307.55,307.95],["the",307.95,308.13],["brush",308.13,308.33],["strokes",308.33,308.73]]},{"start":308.73,"end":312.49,"text":"in the oil painting to create a sense of movement was amazing.","words":[["in",308.73,308.95],["the",308.95,309.07],["oil",309.07,309.27],["painting",309.27,309.75],["to",309.75,310.01],["create",310.01,310.31],["a",310.31,310.53],["sense",310.53,310.77],["of",310.77,310.97],["movement",310.97,311.55],["was",311.55,311.97],["amazing.",311.97,312.49]]},{"start":312.49,"end":318.95,"text":"Hmm, it takes a long time to develop skill like that. Maybe we'll get there one day.","words":[["Hmm,",312.49,313.37],["it",314.01,314.23],["takes",314.23,314.41],["a",314.41,314.59],["long",314.59,314.75],["time",314.75,315.21],["to",315.21,315.47],["develop",315.47,315.83],["skill",315.83,316.19],["like",316.19,316.49],["that.",316.49,316.75],["Maybe",317.41,317.85],["we'll",317.85,318.13],["get",318.13,318.27],["there",318.27,318.49],["one",318.49,318.67],["day.",318.67,318.95]]},{"start":319.85,"end":324.11,"text":"What I liked about the City Life exhibition was the fact that, although the paintings","words":[["What",319.85,320.09],["I",320.09,320.27],["liked",320.27,320.55],["about",320.55,320.79],["the",320.79,320.99],["City",320.99,321.19],["Life",321.19,321.45],["exhibition",321.45,321.99],["was",321.99,322.47],["the",322.47,322.63],["fact",322.63,322.85],["that,",322.85,323.05],["although",323.39,323.63],["the",323.63,323.85],["paintings",323.85,324.11]]},{"start":324.11,"end":330.71,"text":"themselves were of busy places, the display itself wasn't crowded at all. Perhaps the","words":[["themselves",324.11,324.81],["were",324.81,325.39],["of",325.39,325.61],["busy",325.61,325.87],["places,",325.87,326.33],["the",326.93,327.03],["display",327.03,327.43],["itself",327.43,327.85],["wasn't",327.85,328.43],["crowded",328.43,328.83],["at",328.83,329.03],["all.",329.03,329.39],["Perhaps",330.09,330.41],["the",330.41,330.71]]},{"start":330.71,"end":335.57,"text":"fact that the paintings were actually quite small was what created a more open feeling","words":[["fact",330.71,330.91],["that",330.91,331.17],["the",331.17,331.27],["paintings",331.27,331.55],["were",331.55,331.89],["actually",331.89,332.21],["quite",332.21,332.49],["small",332.49,332.91],["was",332.91,333.37],["what",333.37,333.91],["created",333.91,334.37],["a",334.37,334.53],["more",334.53,334.65],["open",334.65,335.07],["feeling",335.07,335.57]]},{"start":335.57,"end":336.49,"text":"to the exhibition.","words":[["to",335.57,335.81],["the",335.81,335.95],["exhibition.",335.95,336.49]]},{"start":336.87,"end":340.79,"text":"Yeah, so the way they were arranged wasn't especially unusual.","words":[["Yeah,",336.87,337.29],["so",337.63,337.87],["the",337.87,338.09],["way",338.09,338.29],["they",338.29,338.45],["were",338.45,338.65],["arranged",338.65,339.23],["wasn't",339.23,339.73],["especially",339.73,340.15],["unusual.",340.15,340.79]]},{"start":340.79,"end":343.31,"text":"And then there was the Faces Exhibition.","words":[["And",340.79,341.47],["then",341.47,341.59],["there",341.59,341.73],["was",341.73,341.87],["the",341.87,342.01],["Faces",342.01,342.39],["Exhibition.",342.39,343.31]]},{"start":343.61,"end":349.67,"text":"Yeah, I mean painting people's portraits isn't a new thing, but what I did like was the way","words":[["Yeah,",343.61,343.99],["I",344.13,344.23],["mean",344.23,344.43],["painting",344.43,344.95],["people's",344.95,345.53],["portraits",345.53,345.97],["isn't",345.97,346.43],["a",346.43,346.57],["new",346.57,346.79],["thing,",346.79,347.21],["but",347.43,348.01],["what",348.01,348.17],["I",348.17,348.31],["did",348.31,348.53],["like",348.53,348.93],["was",348.93,349.39],["the",349.39,349.55],["way",349.55,349.67]]},{"start":349.67,"end":354.59,"text":"the artist managed to reproduce the exact tones of the skin and hair of the people","words":[["the",349.67,349.83],["artist",349.83,350.13],["managed",350.13,350.59],["to",350.59,350.83],["reproduce",350.83,351.13],["the",351.13,351.51],["exact",351.51,351.99],["tones",351.99,352.49],["of",352.49,352.85],["the",352.85,352.99],["skin",352.99,353.39],["and",353.39,353.65],["hair",353.65,354.05],["of",354.05,354.25],["the",354.25,354.35],["people",354.35,354.59]]},{"start":354.59,"end":355.29,"text":"in the pictures.","words":[["in",354.59,354.77],["the",354.77,354.85],["pictures.",354.85,355.29]]},{"start":355.87,"end":359.25,"text":"And the last exhibition we went to see was Moods.","words":[["And",355.87,356.15],["the",356.15,356.29],["last",356.29,356.63],["exhibition",356.63,357.19],["we",357.19,357.49],["went",357.49,357.67],["to",357.67,357.83],["see",357.83,358.11],["was",358.11,358.37],["Moods.",358.37,359.25]]},{"start":359.73,"end":365.71,"text":"Mmm, I expected that to show emotions, people laughing, crying, whatever.","words":[["Mmm,",359.73,360.21],["I",360.59,360.95],["expected",360.95,361.33],["that",361.33,361.87],["to",361.87,362.09],["show",362.09,362.35],["emotions,",362.35,363.03],["people",363.79,364.05],["laughing,",364.05,364.57],["crying,",364.85,365.21],["whatever.",365.49,365.71]]},{"start":366.33,"end":367.57,"text":"But it was about plants.","words":[["But",366.33,366.63],["it",366.63,366.71],["was",366.71,366.83],["about",366.83,367.03],["plants.",367.03,367.57]]},{"start":367.57,"end":372.09,"text":"You don't tend to think of trees and flowers having feelings.","words":[["You",367.57,368.49],["don't",368.49,368.75],["tend",368.75,368.97],["to",368.97,369.17],["think",369.17,369.35],["of",369.35,369.49],["trees",369.49,370.05],["and",370.05,370.47],["flowers",370.47,371.03],["having",371.03,371.53],["feelings.",371.53,372.09]]},{"start":372.51,"end":374.07,"text":"And I'm not sure they do.","words":[["And",372.51,372.81],["I'm",372.81,373.03],["not",373.03,373.21],["sure",373.21,373.47],["they",373.47,373.73],["do.",373.73,374.07]]},{"start":374.63,"end":376.99,"text":"But it certainly seemed that way in the pictures.","words":[["But",374.63,374.85],["it",374.85,375.01],["certainly",375.01,375.43],["seemed",375.43,375.89],["that",375.89,376.19],["way",376.19,376.39],["in",376.39,376.51],["the",376.51,376.61],["pictures.",376.61,376.99]]},{"start":377.85,"end":381.33,"text":"Not the most obvious choice of subject, that's for sure.","words":[["Not",377.85,378.37],["the",378.37,378.57],["most",378.57,378.81],["obvious",378.81,379.33],["choice",379.33,379.73],["of",379.73,379.99],["subject,",379.99,380.51],["that's",380.77,380.99],["for",380.99,381.11],["sure.",381.11,381.33]]},{"start":381.73,"end":383.87,"text":"Anyway, I guess we'd better get on with it.","words":[["Anyway,",381.73,381.93],["I",382.41,382.55],["guess",382.55,382.73],["we'd",382.73,382.97],["better",382.97,383.17],["get",383.17,383.37],["on",383.37,383.57],["with",383.57,383.73],["it.",383.73,383.87]]},{"start":387.03,"end":389.09,"text":"That is the end of section 3.","words":[["That",387.03,387.49],["is",387.49,387.61],["the",387.61,387.77],["end",387.77,388.13],["of",388.13,388.33],["section",388.33,388.59],["3.",388.59,389.09]]},{"start":389.89,"end":392.49,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",389.89,390.09],["now",390.09,390.35],["have",390.35,390.67],["half",390.67,390.95],["a",390.95,391.13],["minute",391.13,391.35],["to",391.35,391.59],["check",391.59,391.89],["your",391.89,392.07],["answers.",392.07,392.49]]},{"start":422.8,"end":425.8,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",422.8,423.2],["turn",423.2,423.46],["to",423.46,423.66],["section",423.66,423.94],["4",423.94,424.42],["on",424.42,425.06],["page",425.06,425.36],["7.",425.36,425.8]]}]}